Read the two floor lines before any other. The twin arms are identical in
every renderer counter, so their gap is what this rig cannot tell apart —
and the worst within-arm spread is the honest bound, since the twins can
agree by luck. Any line inside them has not been measured.

The `geometry` line moves triangles 128-fold with the draw count pinned at
exactly 334; the `materials` line moves 20 materials to 1 with the draw
count pinned too. #56 changed draws, triangles and materials in one step
and read the sum as the first of the three.
